# Optional: GoatCounter analytics code (e.g. "dwarkoptimus" if you signed up
# at https://dwarkoptimus.goatcounter.com). Leave unset locally so your own
# pnpm dev / pnpm build runs do not pollute the dashboard.
#
# Production deploys read this from the GitHub Actions secret
# VITE_GOATCOUNTER_CODE — set it in repo Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions.
VITE_GOATCOUNTER_CODE=
